          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“BWANA Mlungu wako ukameria kuriinja imbiri enyu iro mbari mchaarisoka isanga, mkameria kurisoka na kukaia andenyi yaro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mkulindie msewado ni mdegho ghosunga wutasi ghwawo nyuma ya awo kutoteshwa imbiri konyu; hata msekotie malagho gha milungu yawo seji itaswagha, wei na inyo mtase woruwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msebonye huwo kwa BWANA Mlungu onyu; kwa kukaia iro maza rose rimzamiagha BWANA Mlungu wako, niro reni wiribonyeragha milungu yawo; hata wadaifunyira wana wawo wa womi na wa waka kizongona kwa kuwikora modonyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
